    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηνον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, τό, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρᾱνον</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ch.</u>
			396
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			Mosch.
			1.12
		</span></i> (
			Ion.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.87
				</span></i>
			); in derivs. the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ</span>
			prevails: (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρα</span>
				A):—<i>head</i>, mostly in pl. (as always in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν κάρηνα</span>, periphr.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.500
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκύων ἀμενηνὰ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.521
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶν ἴφθιμα κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.260
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππων ξανθὰ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				9.407
			</span></i>: metaph., of mountain <i>peaks</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οὐλύμποιο κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				1.44
			</span></i>, etc.; of towns, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλάων πολίων κατέλυσε κάρηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.117
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				9.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μυκάλης αἰπεινὰ κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				2.869
			</span></i>: in pl., of a single person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηνα . . Μελανίππου σπάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					537
				</span></i>
			: sg. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				8.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28.8
			</span></i>, Mosch.ll. cc., <i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				264
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anacreont.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>.</div>
